#: ../../installation.rst:27
msgid ""
"Run the installer. It is a **per-user** installation: no administrator "
"rights are required and nothing is written outside your profile."
msgstr "运行安装程序。这是**按用户**安装：不需要管理员权限，也不会向用户目录之外写入任何内容。"

#: ../../installation.rst:30
msgid "Program files: ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Orbit``"
msgstr "程序文件：``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Orbit``"

#: ../../installation.rst:31
msgid "Settings and logs: ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit``"
msgstr "设置与日志：``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit``"

#: ../../installation.rst:33
msgid ""
"The installer offers a desktop shortcut (off by default) and can launch "
"Orbit when it finishes."
msgstr "安装程序可选择创建桌面快捷方式（默认关闭），并在结束时可直接启动 Orbit。"

#: ../../installation.rst:38
msgid ""
"The executable is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen may show "
"*\"Windows protected your PC\"*. Choose **More info → Run anyway**."
msgstr ""
"可执行文件未做代码签名，Windows SmartScreen 可能弹出 *\"Windows 已保护你的电脑\"*。请选择 **更多信息 → "
"仍要运行**。"

#: ../../installation.rst:42
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: ../../installation.rst:44
msgid "Open the ``.dmg`` and drag **Orbit** into *Applications*."
msgstr "打开 ``.dmg``，把 **Orbit** 拖入 *应用程序*。"

#: ../../installation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The build is ad-hoc signed but **not notarized**, so the first launch is "
"blocked by Gatekeeper. Either:"
msgstr "该构建只做了临时签名（ad-hoc），**未经过公证**，因此首次启动会被 Gatekeeper 拦截。可以任选一种方式："

