msgid ""
"If macOS reports the app is *damaged and can't be opened*, the quarantine"
" attribute is the cause — the ``xattr`` command above fixes it."
msgstr "如果 macOS 提示应用 *已损坏，无法打开*，那是隔离属性（quarantine）导致的 — 上面那条 ``xattr`` 命令即可解决。"

