#: ../../installation.rst:60
msgid ""
"The frozen build accepts the same options as the Python module, which is "
"handy for scripts and for running several instances side by side."
msgstr "打包后的程序接受与 Python 模块相同的选项，便于写脚本，也便于同时运行多个实例。"

